OL,3,GNEWSATwo runners died during Great
OL,4,ANorth Run
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo 25-year-old men have died after
OL,7,Fcollapsing during the Great North Run,
OL,8,Fthe event's organiser said.
OL,10,FBoth participants died after falling
OL,11,Fill on the half marathon route on
OL,12,FSunday, which runs from Newcastle to
OL,13,FSouth Shields.
OL,15,FThe Great Run Company said both men
OL,16,Fwere from the north-east of England and
OL,17,Fpassed away despite the best efforts of
OL,18,Fthe event's medical team.
OL,20,FA spokesperson said the causes of death
OL,21,Fwill be determined in due course.
